******************************** Data Format ***********************************

Column 01: Month
Column 02: Hour
Column 03: Frequency (MHz)
Column 04: D - Path distance (km)
Column 05: BMUF - Path basic MUF (MHz)
Column 06: E - Path Field Strength (dB(1uV/m))
