Column 10: "Not otherwise included loss" (dB)
Column 11: Upper Reference Frequency (MHz)
Column 12: Lower Reference Frequency (MHz)
Column 13: Correction Factor at T + d0/2
Column 14: Correction Factor at R - d0/2
Column 15: Max Antenna Gain G_tl (0 - 8 deg)
Column 16: Max Antenna Gain G_rw (0 - 8 deg)
Column 17: Mean gyrofrequency
Column 18: Scale factor f(f ,fL, fM, fH)

